# What `railway up` uploads.
#
# A whitelist of one file. `npm run build` packs the entire artefact into
# `deploy.tar` (scripts/pack-deploy.mjs) precisely so this list can be this short:
# an ignore rule cannot reach inside a tarball, and two deploys were lost to rules
# that did — `content` also matching .next/standalone/content, `node_modules` also
# matching the standalone's traced dependencies.
#
# `deploy.tar` is gitignored, and the CLI combines this file with `.gitignore`,
# so the negation below is what puts it back.
*
!deploy.tar
!Dockerfile
